## P6: the optional body-part argument of the `damage` command.

damage-command-arg-body-part = [body part]
damage-command-error-body-part = {$arg} is not a valid concrete body part.
damage-command-error-missing-body-part = Entity {$target} has no body part {$part}.
damage-command-error-part-damage = Entity {$target} does not support localized body-part damage.
